  "description": "In dirt we trust!\nFor years we have been the leaders of the dirt jump scene with our Movement bike range. Built around a frame that has the same geometry and specs as the Crankworx winning Decade, the Movement will meet the expectations of the most demanding riders.\nToday, this legend is back, this time with refreshed specs, including a rotor-ready head tube and built in chain tensioners – a feature that will take away the headaches of aligning the rear wheel.\nThe Movement 1 as our best-spec'd Dirt bike, comes with a good spec for the price - with the Marzocchi Bomber Z2 in front and RaceFace Aeffect crankset.\nWith the great, redesigned Movement frame, it's the best way to kick-start your dirt jumping adventure!\nStay True!\nTough and light alloy frame\nBrand new tensioners to keep your rear wheel in place on big slams!\nRotor-ready head tube\nMarzocchi Bomber Z2, 100mm travel, 15mm thru axle, Air spring\nBeefier tyres: blast through dirt jumps and without worrying about washing out!\nNew generation of Movement is even better than the last one. Updated frame has rotor-ready headtube, which will make your path to unlimited barspins much easier.\nIt also features new rear wheel mounts, equipped with chain tensioners, so you can stop worrying about dropping a chain and keep focusing on progress!",
